    "standardized_narrative": "The syndicate reported a gross prior year reserve release of GBP 4.042 million for the 2019 financial year. This movement reflects a mixed development across prior underwriting years. The 2017 year of account closed with an overall profit of GBP 9.3 million, indicating favourable development, despite specific strengthenings to long tail international casualty reserves due to catastrophe events such as Hurricanes Harvey, Irma, and Maria, earthquakes in Mexico, and wildfires in California. Conversely, the 2018 year of account was forecast to make a mid-point loss of GBP 7.0 million, impacted by catastrophe events including the Hawaii lava flow, Typhoon Jebi, Hurricanes Florence and Michael, and Californian wildfires Camp and Woolsey, suggesting adverse development for that year.",
